sequenceDiagram
  actor L as Learner
  participant P as Player (XState)
  participant A as API (tRPC)
  participant S as Auth middleware
  participant G as Grader
  participant M as Step state machine
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  L->>P: Submit prediction
  P->>A: steps.attempt(stepId, answer)
  A->>S: Resolve learner from session cookie
  S-->>A: learnerId or UNAUTHORIZED
  A->>D: Load step secret (answers stay server-side)
  A->>G: Grade answer (multiple choice / fill-in-the-blank)
  G-->>A: correct?
  A->>D: BEGIN, insert step_progress if missing, SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  D-->>A: locked step_progress row
  A->>M: next(progress, attempt)
  M-->>A: new progress or conflict (409, no attempt or hint written)
  A->>D: UPDATE step_progress, INSERT attempt or hint event, COMMIT
  A-->>P: Outcome + only what the new state permits
  P-->>L: Hint, retry or reveal
